Re8 3. f4 { Now that the Queen is on e4, we can attack the Bishop, which cannot move since e8 will fall. } d5 4. Bxe5 $1 { Winning the Bishop while counterattacking c7. } dxe4 5. Bxc7 { White is up a piece. } 
