1. { -KEY- } Rxe5 { The e5 Bishop was technically overprotected with 2 attackers and 3 defenders. However, Black's d7 Queen and a8 Rook were unprotected. This invalidates Black's defence from the d6 pawn and e8 Rook respectively. } Rxe5 { Taking with the Rook leaves the a8 Rook hanging. } ( 1... dxe5 { The d6 pawn was not a real defender because the d7 Queen would fall. } 2. Qxd7 ) 
2. Qxa8 { White has essentially won a piece. } 
