1. { -KEY- } Bb3 { Black has an unprotected c7 Knight, c8 Bishop, and h7 pawn. However, all of these are rather inaccessible. Instead, the only exploitable tactical weakness is the trappable Queen on a3, who only has the f3 and g3 escape squares. Hence, we cover both of these squares with Bb3. } Nd5 { Now all that remains is attacking the Queen somehow. } 2. Nc4 { The Queen is trapped and White will gain a substantial material advantage. } Qxb3 3. cxb3 
